`docker exec -d dev_nginx nginx -c /tmp/agent-hub-sse-verify/sse.conf` — `-d` detaches. But `docker exec -d` returns immediately; nginx daemonizes. Need to wait for port 80 readiness. We can poll from host: `http://127.0.0.1:18088/verify-nginx-health` (through mapping) or `docker exec ... wget -qO- http://127.0.0.1/verify-nginx-health`. From host with proxy bypass, fetch health endpoint. Poll up to 10s. Also check error log if fail.

